        "TileImage": "$($repository 11ec70e9-ebe6-43a7-bd73-f2135e00a115).Image",
        "Description": "My first contract. Suprisingly it became quite an interesting puzzle for you to solve. Might be a bit hard, either way: Good luck!\r\rBriefing: Good morning 47. You have been hired by Kronstadt Industries to eliminate Rafferty Butler and Ben Estevez. After being fired, in his anger Kronstadt Mechanic Rafferty decided to leak company secrets to journalist Ben Estevez. They are meeting today in the driver&apos;s lounge. The lounge is swarming with civilians, mechanics and guards, proceed with caution.",
